@host = https://mohamed-cherif-addressbook-4806-f6e4gdeqhegzbudn.westus-01.azurewebsites.net

### 1. Create an address book
POST {{host}}/addressBooks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2a. Create buddy 1
POST {{host}}/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "phoneNumber": "613-555-1234",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "gender": "female"
}

### 2b. Create buddy 2
POST {{host}}/buddies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mohamed Cherif",
  "phoneNumber": "613-333-2233",
  "email": "mbah@example.com",
