### 3a. Add buddy 1 to address book 1
PUT {{host}}/buddies/1/addressBook
Content-Type: text/uri-list

{{host}}/addressBooks/1

### 3b. Add buddy 2 to address book 1
PUT {{host}}/buddies/2/addressBook
